WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:06.858
Welcome to The Logic Grid: logic and number
puzzle games, free to play in your browser.

2
00:00:07.908 --> 00:00:09.978
Choose a game from the cards.

3
00:00:11.028 --> 00:00:17.023
The Fantastical Logic Grid. Story logic
puzzles where every case is brand new.

4
00:00:18.073 --> 00:00:22.341
NINETIMESNINE. Number puzzles, with five ways
to play.

5
00:00:23.391 --> 00:00:29.258
New: Submit Puzzle Ideas. Make your own puzzle
for either game, step by step.

6
00:00:29.608 --> 00:00:32.866
It checks your puzzle has exactly one answer,

7
00:00:32.886 --> 00:00:37.481
gives you a PDF to print, and saves it to your
Saved puzzles.

8
00:00:38.531 --> 00:00:43.609
Choose which puzzle to make, and the wizard
asks only what that puzzle needs.

9
00:00:44.659 --> 00:00:50.035
One account works in every game: your saves,
stats and settings follow you.

10
00:00:50.385 --> 00:00:55.826
Messages, ideas, problem reports and
installing the app are all here too.

11
00:00:56.876 --> 00:01:00.333
Pick your puzzle, or make your own. Happy
puzzling!

